{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "77c8802eb26f273deec326bd441d2662d4f2fe70959bdff1d0dd627442ad640f", "ja": "ネット生配信番組「Jelly PoP Beansの\nレトロポップランド！」が配信開始！\nみんなの思い出の遊園地から、キュートで\n懐かしい時間をお届けしちゃいます♪", "zh": "网络直播节目《Jelly PoP Beans的复古流行乐园！》开始播出！\n从大家记忆中的游乐园，为大家带来可爱又令人怀念的时光♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1000_025roc", "source_sha256": "7de338860d00577700de2b617159d02dcde3d2cbe2d9379f65948c24b7e5ace7", "ja": "Jelly PoP Beansのレトロポップランド！\nキュートで懐かしい時間をみんなにお届け♪", "zh": "Jelly PoP Beans的复古流行乐园！\n把可爱又令人怀念的时光带给大家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7de338860d00577700de2b617159d02dcde3d2cbe2d9379f65948c24b7e5ace7", "ja": "Jelly PoP Beansのレトロポップランド！\nキュートで懐かしい時間をみんなにお届け♪", "zh": "Jelly PoP Beans的复古流行乐园！\n把可爱又令人怀念的时光带给大家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c7a7c1d00d9a024f14febe6e666ad23c31c39d35889d0037087ce0854bb27eb7", "ja": "みんな、元気？　この番組は、アタシたち\nJelly PoP Beansがお届けする生配信だよ！", "zh": "大家还好吗？这档节目是由我们\nJelly PoP Beans为大家带来的直播哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "70806295d4af783b8f070404b5598da23550ebabbdfd7697421c2feb73795251", "ja": "遊園地から生放送なんて、すごいだろ？\nここはアタシたちにとって思い出深い場所なんだ。", "zh": "从游乐园进行现场直播，厉害吧？这里对我们来说可是个充满回忆的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "557c0b834b247084eefb661bee603aa4a2c6a1de0d0ee5da82814662904fefda", "ja": "Jelly PoP Beans初公演ライブの成功を\nお祝いして、みんなで遊んだ所なんですよ。", "zh": "这里是大家为了庆祝Jelly PoP Beans\n首次公演演出成功，一起玩过的地方哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "770c04b372c2ff1e0f986fc45cf4b331b5ce77136a1ea69ff2ae1537d4a53243", "ja": "また来れて、ハッピーです！　とてもノスタルジックで\nキュートな遊園地なので、皆さんもぜひ来てください♪", "zh": "能再次来到这里，我很开心！这里是一座既怀旧又可爱的游乐园，大家也一定要来哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "26e12f908399437db8857aeff9447886a020ecda9314c28be8f215153fe78ae3", "ja": "ここから、アタシ達のドラマのこととか、ちょっとした\n思い出とか話していくから、最後までお見逃しなく！", "zh": "接下来我会聊聊我们的剧，还有一些小小的回忆，大家一定要看到最后哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "93e107715424326c689acdeb3bc5036844154a45ff366abfe63577d54c7c6e60", "ja": "ところで、遊園地といえば、アトラクション！\nってことで……。", "zh": "说到游乐园，当然就是游乐设施啦！\n所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "c222c5e55a9baeef374701b7e7951d091eb73a0ea7319ea6573daae26f59051e", "ja": "モモコとスバルが、観覧車にライドしているんですよ♪\nさっそく呼んでみましょう！", "zh": "桃子和昴正在乘坐摩天轮哦♪\n赶紧叫叫她们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "11cc1b1344b3f293a1cb54d7025642016e263ef642f1e332b93facd9c5d3db45", "ja": "モモコ、スバルー！　\nそっちはどうですかー！？", "zh": "桃子、昴——！\n你们那边怎么样啦——？！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "90f0e93ef23b2f7c9bcc0579dccfdd2e62d9678277866b56b602e2836037cfce", "ja": "はーい！　みんな、オレ達、ちゃんと映ってる？\nこっちは、ちょうど一番上に来たところだぜ！", "zh": "来啦！大家，我们有好好映入画面吗？\n我们这边正好到最顶端了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "80ff0590bc3681700b6ce67190dbf284b474d8d2e32d1501da4e7ef2c30473aa", "ja": "はい、バッチリ映ってますよ！\nそっちはどんな景色ですか？", "zh": "是的，拍得清清楚楚！\n你那边看到的是什么景色？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "3199a8d5fe135e817e1f45cda12e3352618397a83d13ed8dc150392bda233fbb", "ja": "えっとね、すごくキレイ。\n遠くまで見えてて……あ、桃子たちの劇場も見えるよ！", "zh": "那个……特别漂亮。\n能看到很远的地方……啊，还能看到桃子她们的剧场哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "49c8c86143dc8caff4de1447cfb46dd7dfc497024459d50438b15df9fcd1c9fc", "ja": "ホントだ！　オレ、こんな高いところから劇場見るの\n初めてだよ。屋上って、あんな風に見えるんだな！", "zh": "真的！我还是第一次从这么高的地方看剧场。原来从屋顶看过去，是那个样子啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "8de9e438503826afa4feca2c6da98d9308da2b748c3d0c75fc5db172ee79008c", "ja": "なんだか、こうして見ると意外とコンパクトなんだね。\nいつもは、すごく大きく感じるのに。", "zh": "总觉得从这里看，意外地挺紧凑的呢。\n明明平时总觉得它特别大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "2b702905b0d727aec2e76231ec60760549e05eee010b2f44878fc9d4e4915ca0", "ja": "そうだよな……。だから、\n劇場で野球やると怒られるのかな？", "zh": "是啊……所以，\n在剧场里打棒球会挨骂吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "3be473f1940d4b616913c05870ba17be17042b38f00a54005bc0645b31b3f5c2", "ja": "もう！　広くても、部屋の中で野球なんて\nしたらダメでしょ？", "zh": "真是的！就算地方很宽敞，也不能在房间里打棒球吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "daeea760efee06b956308564a84c04e8c3f947824deb23cfb27cd5996da0662f", "ja": "わっ！　ご、ごめん、桃子。って……そ、そろそろ、\n最初のコーナーの時間だぜ。降りる準備しないと……。", "zh": "哇！对、对不起，桃子。不对……差、差不多该到\n第一个环节的时间了。得准备下去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "62fc9f7867c0985085b7f68d10d69334f4ef8e2ea624d238773810c8e48263f3", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。この後、VTRが入るから、\n慌てなくても、ちゃんと間に合うんだからね。", "zh": "没事的。之后会放一段VTR，\n不用慌张，完全来得及啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "9d7351c995f69b2b58e4e22a6bfef2ce9a7cd35f7219be471aeecb703e5719c8", "ja": "それじゃあ、ロコさんと歩さんにお返しするね！\nロコさん、歩さん、よろしく！", "zh": "那么接下来就把现场交还给ROCO和步啦！\nROCO、步，拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "d4ccbf04890aeca526e45aecd70592895b9671df0644d27658f6230123924300", "ja": "モモコ、スバル、サンクスです！\nとっても楽しい中継でしたね！", "zh": "桃子、昴，谢谢你们！\n真是一场特别开心的直播呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e7d61780e30f34fa0fedab4ad747fa2d81bac0f30a5712eda697b429c7a3f824", "ja": "はははっ！　なんだか、\n桃子の方が年上みたいだったよな。", "zh": "哈哈哈！总觉得，\n桃子反而更像年长的一方呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0183_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0183_story_01_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ea3f04803a85a3b4bf9702f425f7c79b5a10a5c0dfc1e2304e22579a34e37925", "ja": "さて、それじゃあ、最初のコーナーなんだけど……。\nその前に、こちらをどうぞ！", "zh": "那么，接下来是第一个环节……  \n在那之前，请看这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
